    "excerpt": "So I took the pure long-side Turtle code \u2014 20-day breakout, 10-day exit, ATR stops \u2014 and let it loose on: \u2026 Including: Bitcoin & Ethereum \u2026 Buy when price breaks above the highest high of the last 20 days. \u2026 Exit when price reverses direction for 10 days. \u2026 18 years of data (2007-2025) \u2026 Total profit across all 43 markets: $1,147,318 \u2026 It's completely misleading.",
    "performance_claim": "Total profit across all 43 markets: $1,147,318",
    "verbatim_confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Turtle 20/10 Donchian long-only; result is pooled over 43 futures markets incl. BTC/ETH, so per-asset claim is not stated; author himself calls aggregate misleading."
